not the payout."}, {"seq": 26, "day": 1, "hour": 17.55257500000057, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "The Broken Choir \u00b7 a garden answer accepted. Read the route, danger and fixed reward."}, {"seq": 27, "day": 1, "hour": 17.684875000000783, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Operate the west handle on the broad grounded apron beyond the Mirror Causeway. Its single notch marks the first isolated support. Set the east and crown relays in either order; all three are required before the service core wakes. The west Arcade service walk remains another way back to the Garden."}, {"seq": 28, "day": 1, "hour": 17.70737500000082, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Operate the east handle opposite the west relay. Its two notches identify it without pitch or color alone. Set the west and crown relays if either is still unset. The bearing is isolated only when all three supports have been recorded for this accepted repair."}, {"seq": 29, "day": 1, "hour": 17.730100000000856, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Operate the three-notch handle on the grounded northern apron, south of the closed terrace. Complete any remaining west/east relay. When the third handle is set, the service core at (0, -95) becomes the declared encounter; the summit road stays closed and the route south stays open."}, {"seq": 30, "day": 1, "hour": 17.857900000001063, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Optional preparation. Yselle: \u201cSend the return pressure into the side basin; the bearing will take longer to rise.\u201d Operate the marked service handle east of the Garden. This costs no material and extends the core\u2019s actual recovery opening by 0.8 seconds. You can omit it and still finish; continue north to the three relay handles."}, {"seq": 31, "day": 1, "hour": 18.012250000001313, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Crownkeeper service core disabled through its actual combat opening."}, {"seq": 32, "day": 1, "hour": 18.14050000000152, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "At the Garden response plate, physically fit the released return arm. Rielle: \u201cLeave the hinge where the next pair of hands can reach it.\u201d The repair stops at this useful local instrument; it opens no summit terrain. Return to Rielle at the nearby west bench and choose the explicit claim for the stated fee."}, {"seq": 33, "day": 1, "hour": 18.162100000001555, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "The Broken Choir \u00b7 a garden answer complete \u00b7 +30 XP \u00b7 +12 sunmarks \u00b7 +2 ore. The declared fee is claimed once."}, {"seq": 34, "day": 1, "hour": 18.179650000001583, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "The Open Cage \u00b7 a return that holds accepted. Read the route, danger and fixed reward."}, {"seq": 35, "day": 1, "hour": 18.38170000000191, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Reach Neris on the west Bell Yard apron, outside the closed foundry wall. Neris: \u201cThe door is open. The route still records me as theirs. Check it before asking me to run.\u201d Her preserved measurements identify a cooling handle and two return clamps. Leave her here while you establish safety; first operate cooling at (-34, -70)."}, {"seq": 36, "day": 1, "hour": 18.40015000000194, "kind": "routine", "text": "Ilan is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 37, "day": 1, "hour": 18.40015000000194, "kind": "routine", "text": "Mara is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 38, "day": 1, "hour": 18.40015000000194, "kind": "routine", "text": "Oren is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 39, "day": 1, "hour": 18.426925000001983, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Operate the marked cooling handle beside Moth Cut\u2019s dry service route. Tovan\u2019s measurement sets a finite safe pressure state; this is required route preparation, not an optional steam effect or a new water-diversion choice. Continue to the west clamp at (-30, -86) and east clamp at (14, -100), in either order."}, {"seq": 40, "day": 1, "hour": 18.45032500000202, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Seat the west clamp\u2019s paired pins at the service approach to Bell Yard. One set clamp is insufficient: inspect the east clamp as well. When both are set after cooling, the route Reeve at (-35, -90) activates visibly. Keep the open western road behind you; no door closes."}, {"seq": 41, "day": 1, "hour": 18.515350000002126, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Seat the east clamp on the Bell Yard\u2019s grounded loading apron. Return across the open yard to the west clamp if it remains unset. Both verified clamps and cooling make the rescue route usable; the Reeve at (-35, -90) must then be disabled before Neris is asked to follow."}, {"seq": 42, "day": 1, "hour": 18.621775000002298, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Route Reeve disabled through its actual combat opening."}, {"seq": 43, "day": 1, "hour": 18.644500000002335, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris: \u201cTwo clamps, cooling, and the inspector quiet. I can try that road with you.\u201d Ask her to follow only after all declared safety work is complete. Walk south along Moth Cut, around the culvert and down the western service road, then enter the Refuge by its open south side. She moves at 2.5 route units per second and waits beyond 10; stay close"}, {"seq": 44, "day": 1, "hour": 18.644500000002335, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris waits here. Speak to her to resume."}, {"seq": 45, "day": 1, "hour": 18.646300000002338, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris resumes the safe route. Stay within ten paces."}, {"seq": 46, "day": 1, "hour": 18.681400000002395, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris reached a safe route checkpoint."}, {"seq": 47, "day": 1, "hour": 18.726175000002467, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris reached a safe route checkpoint."}, {"seq": 48, "day": 1, "hour": 18.804250000002593, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris reached a safe route checkpoint."}, {"seq": 49, "day": 1, "hour": 18.88862500000273, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris reached a safe route checkpoint."}, {"seq": 50, "day": 1, "hour": 18.92035000000278, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "Neris reached the Kiln Refuge on the walked route."}, {"seq": 51, "day": 1, "hour": 18.92552500000279, "kind": "realm-trail", "text": "The Open Cage \u00b7 a return that holds complete \u00b7 +35 XP \u00b7 +14 sunmarks \u00b7 +3 ore. The declared fee is claimed once."}, {"seq": 52, "day": 1, "hour": 18.972775000002866, "kind": "local-life", "text": "A Harvest That Leaves a Garden accepted \u00b7 Wick-fed cutting tray. Supplied job parts stay separate from ordinary inventory."}, {"seq": 53, "day": 1, "hour": 18.973000000002866, "kind": "routine", "text": "Ilan is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 54, "day": 1, "hour": 18.973000000002866, "kind": "routine", "text": "Mara is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 55, "day": 1, "hour": 18.973000000002866, "kind": "routine", "text": "Oren is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 56, "day": 1, "hour": 19.069750000003022, "kind": "local-life", "text": "Check the supplied nursery connection. It belongs to these new cuttings; the public planting keeps its existing water."}, {"seq": 57, "day": 1, "hour": 19.069975000003023, "kind": "routine", "text": "Ilan is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 58, "day": 1, "hour": 19.069975000003023, "kind": "routine", "text": "Mara is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 59, "day": 1, "hour": 19.069975000003023, "kind": "routine", "text": "Oren is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 60, "day": 1, "hour": 19.114525000003095, "kind": "local-life", "text": "The supplied tray is assembled and ready to carry. No ordinary timber, fibre or plants were taken."}, {"seq": 61, "day": 1, "hour": 19.181575000003203, "kind": "local-life", "text": "Root the supplied cuttings in their separate nursery. The public sage and pale blossoms remain planted."}, {"seq": 62, "day": 1, "hour": 19.251775000003317, "kind": "routine", "text": "Ilan is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 63, "day": 1, "hour": 19.251775000003317, "kind": "routine", "text": "Mara is heading to family house."}, {"seq": 64, "day": 1, "hour": 19.